# Force LF line endings on every text file under tool/ regardless of the
# checkout platform. Windows CI runners default to core.autocrlf=true, which
# checks .go files out with CRLF; gofmt -l then reports every line of every
# file as changed. Normalizing the checkout keeps fmt-check meaningful on
# every leg of the CI matrix.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The recorded-run transcripts are pty captures whose carriage returns are part of what they
# record, and check:transcripts replays them byte for byte, so they are never normalized.
testdata/transcripts/** -text
